9-jin:p055","text":"過曹，曹共公不禮，欲觀重耳駢脅。曹大夫釐負羈曰：「晉公子賢，又同姓，窮來過我，柰何不禮！」共公不從其謀。負羈乃私遺重耳食，置璧其下。重耳受其食，還其璧。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"曹共公","kind":"person","person_id":"vs4_n7e_1qh_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0016","start":16,"end":22,"surface":"曹大夫釐負羈","kind":"person","person_id":"pft_5o1_zzt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"晉公子","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"共公","kind":"person","person_id":"vs4_n7e_1qh_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"負羈","kind":"person","person_id":"pft_5o1_zzt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p067","text":"五年春，晉文公欲伐曹，假道於衞，衞人弗許。還自河南度，侵曹，伐衞。正月，取五鹿。二月，晉侯、齊侯盟于斂盂。衞侯請盟晉，晉人不許。衞侯欲與楚，國人不欲，故出其君以説晉。衞侯居襄牛，公子買守衞。楚救衞，不卒。晉侯圍曹。三月丙午，晉師入曹，數之以其不用釐負羈言，而用美女乘軒者三百人也。令軍毋入僖負羈宗家以報德。楚圍宋，宋復告急晉。文公欲救則攻楚，爲楚嘗有德，不欲伐也；欲釋宋，宋又嘗有德於晉：患之。先軫曰：「執曹伯，分曹、衞地以與宋，楚急曹、衞，其勢宜釋宋。」於是文公從之，而楚成王乃引兵歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"晉文公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"cont